[E-PARTIAL-CALLBACK] Error: `loop` can't be passed to `useP` here
   ╭─[ reject/partial-callback.sw:9:44 ]
   │
 9 │ def loop (n : Nat) : {Partial} Nat := useP loop n
   │                                            ──┬─  
   │                                              ╰─── `loop` calls `loop`, so as a value it makes requests that only `loop`'s own definition can answer
   │ 
   │ Note 1: `useP`'s parameter has the type `Nat -> {Partial} Nat`, whose row is fixed
   │ 
   │ Note 2: make `useP` polymorphic in the rest of the row: give the parameter the type `Nat -> {Partial | e} Nat`, and add `| e` to `useP`'s own row too
───╯
